      "locked": false,
      "text": "parseMessage() rejects unknown types\n\nGET_GRAPH → {graph, activeNodeId}\nSET_ACTIVE_NODE → targetNode()\nNAVIGATION_PUSH → addNode()\nNAVIGATION_TRAVERSE → traverse()\n\nsync listener, returns true so the\nreply port stays open",
      "fontSize": 11,
      "fontFamily": 2,
