      "versionNonce": 1784095572,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789092764258,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "nodes          Map<nodeId, GraphNode>  — append-only, so\n               abandoned branches survive\ntabToActiveNode      Map<tabId, nodeId>\ntabToStack           Map<tabId, {entries, cursor}>\ntabToPendingRevisit  Map<tabId, nodeId>\n\naddNode()      push, truncating everything past the cursor\ntraverse()     move the cursor ±1 for a USER back/forward\ntargetNode()   in stack → delta for history.go();\n               otherwise → mark a pending revisit\n\ninvariant: walking .parent from the active node yields\nexactly that tab's stack up to the cursor, reversed",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "nodes          Map<nodeId, GraphNode>  — append-only, so\n               abandoned branches survive\ntabToActiveNode      Map<tabId, nodeId>\ntabToStack           Map<tabId, {entries, cursor}>\ntabToPendingRevisit  Map<tabId, nodeId>\n\naddNode()      push, truncating everything past the cursor\ntraverse()     move the cursor ±1 for a USER back/forward\ntargetNode()   in stack → delta for history.go();\n               otherwise → mark a pending revisit\n\ninvariant: walking .parent from the active node yields\nexactly that tab's stack up to the cursor, reversed",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "ah"
    },
