    {
      "id": "el81_846366295",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 56,
      "y": 1131.25,
      "width": 544.3,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "g_m1"
      ],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 222344215,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 1595558868,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789092764258,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "MESSAGE_TYPES        the literal strings on the wire — treat as a stable protocol\nMessageMapping       pairs each type with its request payload and its response\nMessageOf<K>         adds the discriminant from the key, so the two can't disagree\n\nsendMessage(msg, cb)     infers the reply type from msg.type; fire-and-forget\n                         sends swallow the port-closed rejection\nparseMessage(v, allowed) narrows an unknown off the shared bus at each listener\n\nBACKGROUND_MESSAGE_TYPES / EXTENSION_PAGE_MESSAGE_TYPES gate each side, and the\nbackground's `never` default case makes adding a type without a case a compile error",
      "fontSize": 12,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MESSAGE_TYPES        the literal strings on the wire — treat as a stable protocol\nMessageMapping       pairs each type with its request payload and its response\nMessageOf<K>         adds the discriminant from the key, so the two can't disagree\n\nsendMessage(msg, cb)     infers the reply type from msg.type; fire-and-forget\n                         sends swallow the port-closed rejection\nparseMessage(v, allowed) narrows an unknown off the shared bus at each listener\n\nBACKGROUND_MESSAGE_TYPES / EXTENSION_PAGE_MESSAGE_TYPES gate each side, and the\nbackground's `never` default case makes adding a type without a case a compile error",
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "autoResize": true,
      "index": "b0J"
    },
